Z||000005||Coconut||06-12-2001||10:55 PM||||Terrible news indeed  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>FieroGtgirl and I will keep the prayers going for your friend.<P>Some of our forum friends here at Pennock's had said a few prayers for my Mom when she was in DIRE need of them and those prayers helped pull her through a life and death struggle. <BR>I'd like to ask those same folks if they would PLEASE do the same for Dan Correll and his family.<P>God Bless and please keep us posted.<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
