Z||000023||FieroNate||06-19-2001||12:50 AM||||Working with Daniel for about 6 months on his white 85GT with his dad  and my dad makes it very hard to get into my fiero each day. I think of how it must have been, actually I recall the days when I wanted one and I recalled my first ride in my fiero. He was like a brother to me and to see this happen I can't put it in words. I have decided to complete his fiero and am asking for donations toward his paint. He had planned on making the car an Alero blue metallic and putting some nice wheels on it. He had decided to let the local votech where he spent half his school days paint the car. If i can raise the money I will strip the car and take it there to be painted, and finish his car up. <BR>I am still speachless and don't know what to make of anything.<P>------------------<BR>FieroNate@aol.com<BR>87 GT 5 speed<BR>400 HP 3400V6||||reg||9
